{"id":"b2ad50a9c856b15f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SubstH.md","title":"SubstH","display":"SubstH","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SubstH","parameters":["s","a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SubstH"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>s</span><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>s</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>同步命题替换；存在的是固定公式集合上的图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SubstH s a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists f\n  (exists w\n    (exists h\n      (and\n        (@ FormSetH f)\n        (and\n          (@ Omega w)\n          (and\n            (@ Map s w f)\n            (and\n              (@ Map h f f)\n              (and\n                (in a f)\n                (and\n                  (@ App h a b)\n                  (and\n                    (forall n\n                      (forall t (implies (and (@ Nat n) (@ PAtom n t)) (forall u (iff (@ App h t u) (@ App s n u))))))\n                    (and\n                      (forall z219\n                        (forall z220\n                          (forall z223\n                            (implies\n                            (and (in z219 f) (and (in z220 f) (@ PImp z219 z220 z223)))\n                            (exists z221\n                            (exists z222\n                            (exists z224\n                            (and (@ App h z219 z221) (and (@ App h z220 z222) (and (@ PImp z221 z222 z224) (@ App h z223 z224)))))))))))\n                      (and\n                        (forall t (implies (@ PBot t) (@ App h t t)))\n                        (and\n                          (forall z225\n                            (forall z226\n                            (forall z229\n                            (implies\n                            (and (in z225 f) (and (in z226 f) (@ PAnd z225 z226 z229)))\n                            (exists z227\n                            (exists z228\n                            (exists z230\n                            (and (@ App h z225 z227) (and (@ App h z226 z228) (and (@ PAnd z227 z228 z230) (@ App h z229 z230)))))))))))\n                          (and\n                            (forall z231\n                            (forall z232\n                            (forall z235\n                            (implies\n                            (and (in z231 f) (and (in z232 f) (@ POr z231 z232 z235)))\n                            (exists z233\n                            (exists z234\n                            (exists z236\n                            (and (@ App h z231 z233) (and (@ App h z232 z234) (and (@ POr z233 z234 z236) (@ App h z235 z236)))))))))))\n                            (forall t (implies (@ PTop t) (@ App h t t)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5a52694d53e1ba4\" href=\"?note=d5a52694d53e1ba4\" title=\"ZFC_FormSetH\">FormSetH</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" href=\"?note=635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" title=\"ZFC_PAnd\">PAnd</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"892530c42a605aab\" href=\"?note=892530c42a605aab\" title=\"ZFC_POr\">POr</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"6d2e5f9b8bceac9f\" href=\"?note=6d2e5f9b8bceac9f\" title=\"ZFC_PTop\">PTop</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SubstH s a b)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FormSetH|FormSetH]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_PAnd|PAnd]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_POr|POr]]；[[ZFC_PTop|PTop]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FormSetH","status":"resolved","id":"d5a52694d53e1ba4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FormSetH|FormSetH]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZF